- #### **Switch**

        - `Switch`(switch : TrgSwitch, state : TrgSwitchState) : Condition  
            Compare whether the state of [switch] is [state]  

        Example

        ```JavaScript
        if ( Switch($S("Switch 1"), Set) ) {
            // Switch 1 is Set
        }

        if ( Switch($S("Switch 1"), Cleared) ) {
            // Switch 1 is Cleared
        }
